  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Emergency Food Assistance</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Protecci&#xf3;n, Asistencia y Soluciones</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">A humanitarian award to provide emergency life-saving food assistance to 225,000 Venezuelan migrants in Ecuador through hot meals, groceries and supplemental lactation food for mothers with infant children under 5 years of age.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">La provisi&#xf3;n de protecci&#xf3;n, asistencia y soluciones duraderas efectivas para los refugiados, los desplazados internos (PDI) y otras v&#xed;ctimas de conflictos y desastres.</narrative>
  </description>
